{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921060/extras/39f671a1aab8b97194aafe015d13adf5.poster.avif?t=1754103936\" width=960 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921060/extras/39f671a1aab8b97194aafe015d13adf5.webm?t=1754103936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921060/extras/39f671a1aab8b97194aafe015d13adf5.mp4?t=1754103936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921060/extras/c60972b4e2b71ebcafd61557791a24f9.webp?t=1754103936\" width=832 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Indulge in this love letter to beat 'em ups featuring hard hitting arcade action, unique combat abilities, alluring secrets and a world filled with deadly warriors!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Brewstar Crew in their fight against rival gangs, militias and secret organizations throughout the treacherous streets of Neo Babylos!</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921060/extras/b16a8e648e173dc61efe6bc7acf3f615.poster.avif?t=1754103936\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921060/extras/b16a8e648e173dc61efe6bc7acf3f615.webm?t=1754103936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921060/extras/b16a8e648e173dc61efe6bc7acf3f615.mp4?t=1754103936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921060/extras/7d83acd10d0383ee9d8e18f73e044ab7.webp?t=1754103936\" width=832 height=32 /></span><strong>Long ago, the mega metropolis: Neo Babylos emerged from the sky, different worlds forged together by a shadow organization known as the Seven Sons.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eight fierce warriors band together in an unlikely alliance to avenge their destroyed worlds and bring an era of peace to their new home!</strong><br><strong>They will battle ruthless foes and risk everything, even their lives, amidst this Deadly Metropolis!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921060/extras/34b66305452b157609ab29abc93d26e0.avif?t=1754103936\" width=854 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921060/extras/d96bf375b25e569ae9fb247e89882dd0.webp?t=1754103936\" width=832 height=32 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as D-Tag, Songbird, Keemo, and a growing roster of Brawlers, Slashers and Gunslingers</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destroy your enemies with a variety of attacks, special moves, weapons and unique abilities</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the endless mega-metropolis, Neo Babylos, as you tread through various scenes!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brawl your way though an episodic story mode that follows the journey of the Brewstar crew!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play through a variety of game modes such as Arcade, Survival and more!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feast your eyes on a mixture of beautiful, high quality pixel art and 3D graphics!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treat your ears to bone crunching sound effects and a fist pumping soundtrack!</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921060?t=1754103936","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921060?t=1754103936","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921060/c016a2a1dd01ccf701d19005992cf9793a7abc65/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754103936","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921060/c016a2a1dd01ccf701d19005992cf9793a7abc65/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754103936","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921060/extras/39f671a1aab8b97194aafe015d13adf5.poster.avif?t=1754103936\" width=960 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921060/extras/39f671a1aab8b97194aafe015d13adf5.webm?t=1754103936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921060/extras/39f671a1aab8b97194aafe015d13ad