n their lives, amidst this Deadly Metropolis!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921060/extras/34b66305452b157609ab29abc93d26e0.avif?t=1754103936\" width=854 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921060/extras/d96bf375b25e569ae9fb247e89882dd0.webp?t=1754103936\" width=832 height=32 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as D-Tag, Songbird, Keemo, and a growing roster of Brawlers, Slashers and Gunslingers</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destroy your enemies with a variety of attacks, special moves, weapons and unique abilities</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the endless mega-metropolis, Neo Babylos, as you tread through various scenes!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brawl your way though an episodic story mode that follows the journey of the Brewstar crew!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play through a variety of game modes such as Arcade, Survival and more!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feast your eyes on a mixture of beautiful, high quality pixel art and 3D graphics!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treat your ears to bone crunching sound effects and a fist pumping soundtrack!</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["AGAR","Abryt"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921060/5b2adc726d3b3f032b2f5ffb96351308780a770a/header.jpg?t=1754103936","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Deadly Metropolis","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</s